            <note corresp="#d131-f1" n="93" xml:id="d131-f1-content">
                <p>For negotiations and relevant documents, see <hi rendition="#italic">Combined
                        Annual Reports of the World War Foreign Debt Commission</hi>, pp. 79 and
                    278–288.</p>
            </note>
